Dialogue: 1,0:27:51.32,0:27:54.03,TMCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}你的愛
Dialogue: 1,0:27:54.03,0:28:01.95,TMCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}要如何證明？
Dialogue: 1,0:28:01.95,0:28:09.25,TMCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}「除了愛下去  別無他法讓你看見我」
Dialogue: 1,0:28:09.25,0:28:14.55,TMCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}你的背影  喃喃自語…
Dialogue: 1,0:28:14.55,0:28:26.14,TMCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}我感覺好像窺見了真心的一隅
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.10,0:27:14.11,TMJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}ときどき　このからだが
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.57,0:27:25.71,TMJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}よろこびなのか　哀しみなのか
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.71,0:27:29.34,TMJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}わからなくなる
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.34,0:27:35.13,TMJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}鏡の向こう側は
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.43,0:27:47.81,TMJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}真実なのか　ただの光か
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.81,0:27:51.32,TMJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}わからなくなる
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.32,0:27:54.03,TMJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}愛してること
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.03,0:28:01.95,TMJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}どうやって証明してくれるの？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.95,0:28:09.25,TMJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}「愛し続けることでしか僕を見せられない」と
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.25,0:28:14.55,TMJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}つぶやく背中、、、
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.55,0:28:26.14,TMJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur(0.85)}すこし　本物の心が見えた気がした
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,// Dialogue
Dialogue: 9,0:00:06.90,0:00:11.74,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,就像剛才說的  海邊和山裡有很多危險動物
Dialogue: 8,0:00:06.90,0:00:11.74,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,今言ったように　海や山には　危険な動物がたくさんいますから
Dialogue: 9,0:00:11.74,0:00:14.33,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,一定要小心  聽到了嗎？
Dialogue: 8,0:00:11.74,0:00:14.33,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,注意すること　いいですね？
Dialogue: 9,0:00:14.33,0:00:15.33,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:14.33,0:00:15.33,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,はい！
Dialogue: 9,0:00:15.95,0:00:19.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大谷同學  大谷同學！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:15.95,0:00:19.08,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,大谷さん　大谷さん！
Dialogue: 9,0:00:21.25,0:00:22.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,啊…  好！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:21.25,0:00:22.08,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,はっ… はい！
Dialogue: 9,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.59,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,要認真聽講啊  別東張西望的
Dialogue: 8,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.59,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ちゃんと聞いてなきゃダメでしょう　よそ見なんかして
Dialogue: 9,0:00:26.01,0:00:29.51,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不能因為要放暑假了就得意忘形
Dialogue: 8,0:00:26.01,0:00:29.51,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,夏休みになるからって　浮かれてちゃいけませんよ
Dialogue: 9,0:00:35.01,0:00:36.43,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不想幹了？
Dialogue: 8,0:00:35.01,0:00:36.43,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,やめたい？
Dialogue: 9,0:00:39.64,0:00:42.10,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這樣啊  確實
Dialogue: 8,0:00:39.64,0:00:42.10,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,そう　そうね
Dialogue: 9,0:00:42.10,0:00:44.86,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,一直害怕也沒什麼辦法
Dialogue: 8,0:00:42.10,0:00:44.86,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怖くて怖くて仕方ないものね
Dialogue: 9,0:00:44.86,0:00:47.11,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,可是啊  不行
Dialogue: 8,0:00:44.86,0:00:47.11,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,でもね　ダメなの
Dialogue: 9,0:00:47.11,0:00:48.74,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,老師我也沒辦法
Dialogue: 8,0:00:47.11,0:00:48.74,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,先生にもどうしようもないの
Dialogue: 9,0:00:49.86,0:00:53.03,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你不幹是肯定不行的
Dialogue: 8,0:00:49.86,0:00:53.03,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,やめることはできないの　絶対
Dialogue: 9,0:00:54.87,0:00:57.24,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不過你看  也只剩半年了
Dialogue: 8,0:00:54.87,0:00:57.24,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ほら　でもあと半年
Dialogue: 9,0:00:57.24,0:00:59.37,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,只要再努力半年就好了
Dialogue: 8,0:00:57.24,0:00:59.37,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,半年頑張ればいいんだから
Dialogue: 9,0:00:59.37,0:01:01.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,而且就要放暑假了嘛
Dialogue: 8,0:00:59.37,0:01:01.00,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,それに　夏休みでしょう？
Dialogue: 9,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.13,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,把委員的事情拋到腦後
Dialogue: 8,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.13,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,係のことは忘れて
Dialogue: 9,0:01:03.13,0:01:04.67,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,玩個痛快吧
Dialogue: 8,0:01:03.13,0:01:04.67,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いっぱい楽しんでらっしゃい
Dialogue: 9,0:01:20.56,0:01:22.77,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我… 我輸了
Dialogue: 8,0:01:20.56,0:01:22.77,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,まっ… まいった
Dialogue: 9,0:01:22.77,0:01:24.19,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,喂  久美
Dialogue: 8,0:01:22.77,0:01:24.19,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ねえ　くみちゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:01:26.44,0:01:28.98,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,由莉沒事吧
Dialogue: 8,0:01:26.44,0:01:28.98,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ゆりちゃん　大丈夫かな
Dialogue: 9,0:02:11.15,0:02:13.03,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,再這樣下去  她會死的
Dialogue: 8,0:02:11.15,0:02:13.03,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,このままじゃ死んじゃいそう
Dialogue: 9,0:02:15.95,0:02:17.41,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,得想想辦法才行
Dialogue: 8,0:02:15.95,0:02:17.41,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,なんとかしなきゃ
Dialogue: 9,0:02:29.88,0:02:32.09,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,因為我們也體驗過了
Dialogue: 8,0:02:29.88,0:02:32.09,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,私たちも体験したから
Dialogue: 9,0:02:33.01,0:02:34.47,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,由莉的恐懼…
Dialogue: 8,0:02:33.01,0:02:34.47,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ゆりの恐怖…
Dialogue: 9,0:03:05.96,0:03:08.71,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你還打算繼續用那幾個孩子？
Dialogue: 8,0:03:05.96,0:03:08.71,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,まだ　あの子たちでやるつもり？
Dialogue: 9,0:03:08.71,0:03:10.13,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 8,0:03:08.71,0:03:10.13,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,はあ…
Dialogue: 9,0:03:10.13,0:03:13.80,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,現在換人也來不及了
Dialogue: 8,0:03:10.13,0:03:13.80,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,今から　他の子では間に合いませんから
Dialogue: 9,0:03:13.80,0:03:15.51,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,真沒問題嗎？
Dialogue: 8,0:03:13.80,0:03:15.51,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,大丈夫なの？
Dialogue: 9,0:03:15.51,0:03:17.43,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,我可沒辦法再幫你說話了
Dialogue: 8,0:03:15.51,0:03:17.43,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,これ以上弁護できないわよ
Dialogue: 9,0:03:17.43,0:03:20.35,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,是  我…  我會加油的！
Dialogue: 8,0:03:17.43,0:03:20.35,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,はい　がっ… 頑張ります！
Dialogue: 9,0:03:21.10,0:03:22.26,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,挨罵了啊…
Dialogue: 8,0:03:21.10,0:03:22.26,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怒られちゃった…
Dialogue: 9,0:03:28.94,0:03:33.07,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嘿咻  嘿咻  嘿咻
Dialogue: 8,0:03:28.94,0:03:33.07,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,よいしょ　よいっしょ　よいっしょ
Dialogue: 9,0:03:34.36,0:03:35.49,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 8,0:03:34.36,0:03:35.49,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,よいっしょ
Dialogue: 9,0:03:37.32,0:03:38.36,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 8,0:03:37.32,0:03:38.36,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,よいっしょ
Dialogue: 9,0:03:51.42,0:03:53.84,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,做完還要大約一個月
Dialogue: 8,0:03:51.42,0:03:53.84,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,出来上がりまで　約一ヶ月
Dialogue: 9,0:04:01.97,0:04:03.97,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,不過  有一個月的話
Dialogue: 8,0:04:01.97,0:04:03.97,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,まっ　一ヶ月もあれば
Dialogue: 9,0:04:03.97,0:04:05.52,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,孩子們也該恢復了吧
Dialogue: 8,0:04:03.97,0:04:05.52,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,あの子たちも立ち直るでしょ
Dialogue: 9,0:04:06.27,0:04:07.77,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,真期待啊
Dialogue: 8,0:04:06.27,0:04:07.77,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,とっても楽しみ
Dialogue: 9,0:05:52.87,0:05:54.42,Text - CN,**,0,0,0,,好  抓住了！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:52.87,0:05:54.42,Text - JP,**,0,0,0,,よーし　捕まえたぞぉ！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:54.42,0:05:55.17,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:54.42,0:05:55.17,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,やったあ！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:55.17,0:05:56.21,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,厲害！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:55.17,0:05:56.21,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,すげえ！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:56.21,0:05:57.17,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,接著抓吧
Dialogue: 8,0:05:56.21,0:05:57.17,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,次　行こうぜ
Dialogue: 9,0:05:57.17,0:05:57.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:57.17,0:05:57.54,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:57.54,0:05:58.05,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:57.54,0:05:58.05,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:14.31,0:06:15.23,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:14.31,0:06:15.23,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,こら！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.65,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,你要睡到什麼時候
Dialogue: 8,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.65,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,いつまで寝てるの
Dialogue: 9,0:06:18.65,0:06:20.07,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,要睡一個暑假嗎？
Dialogue: 8,0:06:18.65,0:06:20.07,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,夏休み中　寝てるつもり？
Dialogue: 9,0:06:22.53,0:06:24.24,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,差不多起來吧
Dialogue: 8,0:06:22.53,0:06:24.24,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,いい加減にしなさい
Dialogue: 9,0:06:24.24,0:06:26.24,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,朋友都來接你了
Dialogue: 8,0:06:24.24,0:06:26.24,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,友だちが迎えに来てるわよ
Dialogue: 9,0:06:31.62,0:06:32.83,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,玩得開心
Dialogue: 8,0:06:31.62,0:06:32.83,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,行ってらっしゃい
Dialogue: 9,0:06:43.01,0:06:44.63,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,快點  快點！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:43.01,0:06:44.63,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,急いで　急いで！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:44.63,0:06:45.72,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,電車要開了！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:44.63,0:06:45.72,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,電車　出ちゃう！
Dialogue: 9,0:07:02.61,0:07:03.36,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,趕上了
Dialogue: 8,0:07:02.61,0:07:03.36,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,間に合った
Dialogue: 9,0:07:03.36,0:07:04.61,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,急死我了！
Dialogue: 8,0:07:03.36,0:07:04.61,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あせった！
Dialogue: 9,0:07:05.74,0:07:07.11,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真是的  你太磨蹭了
Dialogue: 8,0:07:05.74,0:07:07.11,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,もう　もたもたして
Dialogue: 9,0:07:09.83,0:07:11.87,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美佑  你胃口真好
Dialogue: 8,0:07:09.83,0:07:11.87,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,美佑ちゃん　すごい食欲
Dialogue: 9,0:07:11.87,0:07:14.16,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我早就餓扁了嘛！
Dialogue: 8,0:07:11.87,0:07:14.16,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,もうおなかペコペコだもの！
Dialogue: 9,0:07:14.16,0:07:15.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,會長胖哦
Dialogue: 8,0:07:14.16,0:07:15.08,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,太るよ
Dialogue: 9,0:07:20.46,0:07:21.55,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,噎… 噎死我了！
Dialogue: 8,0:07:20.46,0:07:21.55,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,しっ… 死ぬ！
Dialogue: 9,0:07:21.55,0:07:23.46,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美…  美佑  你沒事吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:07:21.55,0:07:23.46,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,みっ… 美佑　大丈夫？
Dialogue: 9,0:07:33.64,0:07:35.85,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好久不見了  霞大小姐
Dialogue: 8,0:07:33.64,0:07:35.85,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,お久しぶりです　かすみお嬢さま
Dialogue: 9,0:07:37.23,0:07:38.56,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,來  這邊請
Dialogue: 8,0:07:37.23,0:07:38.56,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,さあ　参りましょう
Dialogue: 9,0:07:55.87,0:07:57.79,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,麻煩您了
Dialogue: 8,0:07:55.87,0:07:57.79,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,よろしくお願いします
Dialogue: 9,0:07:58.67,0:07:59.67,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,歡迎
Dialogue: 8,0:07:58.67,0:07:59.67,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いらっしゃい
Dialogue: 9,0:07:59.67,0:08:02.29,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,來  都累了吧  快請進
Dialogue: 8,0:07:59.67,0:08:02.29,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,さあ　疲れたろ　早くお上がり
Dialogue: 9,0:08:02.29,0:08:03.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 8,0:08:02.29,0:08:03.00,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 9,0:08:08.38,0:08:09.34,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 8,0:08:08.38,0:08:09.34,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ちょっと待って
Dialogue: 9,0:08:09.34,0:08:10.18,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,咦  怎麼了？
Dialogue: 8,0:08:09.34,0:08:10.18,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,えっ　何？
Dialogue: 9,0:08:10.43,0:08:12.05,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,來嘛  來嘛
Dialogue: 8,0:08:10.43,0:08:12.05,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いいから　いいから
Dialogue: 9,0:08:13.35,0:08:15.02,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,來  大家一起
Dialogue: 8,0:08:13.35,0:08:15.02,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,行くわよ　みんな
Dialogue: 9,0:08:15.02,0:08:17.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,到達霞家別墅的紀念照
Dialogue: 8,0:08:15.02,0:08:17.31,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,かすみちゃんちの別荘　到着記念
Dialogue: 9,0:08:21.73,0:08:23.19,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,終於到了啊
Dialogue: 8,0:08:21.73,0:08:23.19,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,やっと着いたね
Dialogue: 9,0:08:29.07,0:08:32.16,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好大的別墅啊  你常來嗎？
Dialogue: 8,0:08:29.07,0:08:32.16,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,大きな別荘ね　いつも来てるの？
Dialogue: 9,0:08:32.16,0:08:36.33,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯  去年我也跟哥哥一起來過
Dialogue: 8,0:08:32.16,0:08:36.33,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん　お兄ちゃんと　去年も一緒に来たんだよ
Dialogue: 9,0:08:36.33,0:08:37.96,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你哥哥現在是在國外吧
Dialogue: 8,0:08:36.33,0:08:37.96,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,海外だっけ　お兄さん
Dialogue: 9,0:08:41.75,0:08:42.46,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 8,0:08:41.75,0:08:42.46,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん…
Dialogue: 9,0:08:43.88,0:08:45.96,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,哥哥今年很忙
Dialogue: 8,0:08:43.88,0:08:45.96,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,お兄ちゃん　今年は忙しくて
Dialogue: 9,0:08:45.96,0:08:47.38,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不能回來了
Dialogue: 8,0:08:45.96,0:08:47.38,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,帰ってこれないんだ
Dialogue: 9,0:08:47.76,0:08:50.34,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這樣啊  真遺憾呢
Dialogue: 8,0:08:47.76,0:08:50.34,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,そう　残念ね
Dialogue: 9,0:08:50.34,0:08:51.34,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,由莉
Dialogue: 8,0:08:50.34,0:08:51.34,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ゆり
Comment: 9,0:08:54.10,0:08:55.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,鏘
Comment: 8,0:08:54.10,0:08:55.31,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ジャーン
Dialogue: 9,0:08:57.63,0:08:59.29,Text - CN,*,0,0,0,,哇  真壯觀
Dialogue: 8,0:08:57.63,0:08:59.29,Text - JP,*,0,0,0,,わあ　すごい
Dialogue: 9,0:08:59.29,0:09:00.56,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 8,0:08:59.29,0:09:00.56,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,きれい
Dialogue: 9,0:09:24.00,0:09:25.63,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真漂亮
Dialogue: 8,0:09:24.00,0:09:25.63,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,きれい
Dialogue: 9,0:09:25.63,0:09:28.51,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,很漂亮吧  是我發現的哦
Dialogue: 8,0:09:25.63,0:09:28.51,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,きれいでしょう　私が見つけたのよ
Dialogue: 9,0:09:31.51,0:09:34.51,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好！明天開始盡情玩吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:09:31.51,0:09:34.51,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,よし！明日から思いっきり遊ぶぞー！
Comment: 9,0:09:34.51,0:09:35.39,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,喔！
Comment: 8,0:09:34.51,0:09:35.39,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,おー！
Dialogue: 9,0:09:44.69,0:09:49.24,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好好好好… 好燙好燙好燙！
Dialogue: 8,0:09:44.69,0:09:49.24,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あっ  あっ… あつっ　 あつっ！ あつっ　 あつっ！あつっ　 あつっ！
Dialogue: 9,0:09:49.90,0:09:52.78,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,由莉！快點
Dialogue: 8,0:09:49.90,0:09:52.78,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ゆり！早く
Dialogue: 9,0:09:54.99,0:09:57.46,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,美佑  久美
Dialogue: 8,0:09:54.99,0:09:57.46,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,美佑　くみちゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:09:59.66,0:10:02.75,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,由莉！快點！
Dialogue: 8,0:09:59.66,0:10:02.75,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ゆり！早く！
Dialogue: 9,0:10:03.21,0:10:04.46,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,等…  等等！
Dialogue: 8,0:10:03.21,0:10:04.46,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,まっ… 待って！
Dialogue: 9,0:10:06.50,0:10:09.13,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,快點！
Dialogue: 8,0:10:06.50,0:10:09.13,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,早く！
Dialogue: 9,0:10:09.42,0:10:12.26,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不行啊  不能去那麼遠的地方
Dialogue: 8,0:10:09.42,0:10:12.26,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ダメだよ　そんなとこまで行けないよ
Dialogue: 9,0:10:20.31,0:10:22.89,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,沒事吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:10:20.31,0:10:22.89,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,大丈夫？
Dialogue: 9,0:10:24.23,0:10:26.10,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,喝到海水了
Dialogue: 8,0:10:24.23,0:10:26.10,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,塩水飲んだ
Dialogue: 9,0:11:17.11,0:11:18.87,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好可怕…
Dialogue: 8,0:11:17.11,0:11:18.87,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怖かった…
Dialogue: 9,0:11:18.87,0:11:22.74,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真沒用  不就是試膽而已
Dialogue: 8,0:11:18.87,0:11:22.74,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,だらしないわね　たっかが肝試しぐらいで
Dialogue: 9,0:11:23.50,0:11:25.04,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,橘子拿回來了嗎？
Dialogue: 8,0:11:23.50,0:11:25.04,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ミカンは取ってきた？
Dialogue: 9,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.83,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,那是當然的啦
Dialogue: 8,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.83,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あるわよ　もちろん
Dialogue: 9,0:11:27.83,0:11:28.88,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好啦好啦
Dialogue: 8,0:11:27.83,0:11:28.88,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,よしよし
Dialogue: 9,0:11:29.54,0:11:31.46,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,就差由莉了呢
Dialogue: 8,0:11:29.54,0:11:31.46,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,最後はゆりちゃんだね
Dialogue: 9,0:11:31.46,0:11:32.25,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,由莉
Dialogue: 8,0:11:31.46,0:11:32.25,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ゆり
Dialogue: 9,0:11:32.46,0:11:33.55,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,加油！
Dialogue: 8,0:11:32.46,0:11:33.55,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,頑張！
Dialogue: 9,0:11:33.55,0:11:35.22,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這點小事根本不可怕
Dialogue: 8,0:11:33.55,0:11:35.22,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,こんなの全然平気だって
Dialogue: 9,0:11:35.55,0:11:37.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,你不是也又喊又叫的
Dialogue: 8,0:11:35.55,0:11:37.31,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,悲鳴あげたくせに
Dialogue: 9,0:11:54.99,0:11:59.99,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不可怕  不可怕
Dialogue: 8,0:11:54.99,0:11:59.99,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怖くない　怖くない
Dialogue: 9,0:11:59.99,0:12:01.99,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不可怕的
Dialogue: 8,0:11:59.99,0:12:01.99,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怖くないよ
Dialogue: 9,0:12:01.99,0:12:05.95,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不可怕  不可怕
Dialogue: 8,0:12:01.99,0:12:05.95,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怖くない　怖くない
Dialogue: 9,0:12:05.95,0:12:08.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不可怕
Dialogue: 8,0:12:05.95,0:12:08.08,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怖くない
Dialogue: 9,0:12:08.08,0:12:09.46,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不可怕…
Dialogue: 8,0:12:08.08,0:12:09.46,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怖くな…
Dialogue: 9,0:12:49.00,0:12:50.33,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,不要  不要  不要！
Dialogue: 8,0:12:49.00,0:12:50.33,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,やだ　やだ　やだ！
Dialogue: 9,0:13:28.25,0:13:29.87,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,沒事的  沒事的
Dialogue: 8,0:13:28.25,0:13:29.87,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,大丈夫　大丈夫
Dialogue: 9,0:13:29.87,0:13:32.46,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,這全都是叔叔做的機關而已
Dialogue: 8,0:13:29.87,0:13:32.46,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,全部　おじさんが作った仕掛けなんだから
Dialogue: 9,0:13:32.46,0:13:34.13,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,沒什麼可怕的
Dialogue: 8,0:13:32.46,0:13:34.13,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怖くなんかないよ
Dialogue: 9,0:13:37.30,0:13:38.80,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,沒什麼可怕的
Dialogue: 8,0:13:37.30,0:13:38.80,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怖くなんかない
Dialogue: 9,0:13:38.80,0:13:40.09,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,沒什麼可怕的
Dialogue: 8,0:13:38.80,0:13:40.09,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怖くなんかない
Dialogue: 9,0:14:14.54,0:14:15.46,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,久美
Dialogue: 8,0:14:14.54,0:14:15.46,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,くみちゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:14:15.46,0:14:16.42,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,霞！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:15.46,0:14:16.42,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,かすみ！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:17.59,0:14:19.55,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,等…  等一下
Dialogue: 8,0:14:17.59,0:14:19.55,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ちょ… ちょっと
Dialogue: 9,0:14:20.01,0:14:22.13,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,喂  怎麼了？
Dialogue: 8,0:14:20.01,0:14:22.13,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ねえ　どうしたのよ
Dialogue: 9,0:14:29.06,0:14:30.10,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,由莉！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:29.06,0:14:30.10,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ゆり！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:32.73,0:14:33.60,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,久美！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:32.73,0:14:33.60,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,くみちゃん！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:36.23,0:14:37.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 8,0:14:36.23,0:14:37.31,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,どうしたの？
Dialogue: 9,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.32,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,樹上  有東西！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.32,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,木の上　何かいる！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:39.32,0:14:40.48,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,樹上！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:39.32,0:14:40.48,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,木の上！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:45.45,0:14:46.70,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,是飛鼠啦
Dialogue: 8,0:14:45.45,0:14:46.70,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ムササビだよ
Dialogue: 9,0:14:50.74,0:14:51.37,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 8,0:14:50.74,0:14:51.37,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あれ
Dialogue: 9,0:14:51.37,0:14:52.16,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 8,0:14:51.37,0:14:52.16,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,いたっ
Dialogue: 9,0:14:53.29,0:14:56.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真是的  害我們擔心！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:53.29,0:14:56.00,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,もう　心配させて！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:56.74,0:14:58.88,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大家  別丟下我！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:56.74,0:14:58.88,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,みんな　一人にしないで！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:59.50,0:15:01.67,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,很可怕啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:59.50,0:15:01.67,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怖いじゃない！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:13.90,0:15:17.40,Text - CN,fade,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1200)}等…  等等我  久美！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:13.90,0:15:17.40,Text - JP,fade,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1200)}まっ… 待ってよ　くみちゃん！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:24.03,0:15:25.65,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,由莉！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:24.03,0:15:25.65,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ゆり！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:27.09,0:15:28.62,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,太慢了  太慢了！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:27.09,0:15:28.62,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,遅い　遅い！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:28.62,0:15:30.83,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,要遲到了！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:28.62,0:15:30.83,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,遅刻しちゃうよ
Dialogue: 9,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.04,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 8,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.04,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,あれ？
Dialogue: 9,0:15:34.62,0:15:36.37,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,可是  暑假…
Dialogue: 8,0:15:34.62,0:15:36.37,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,だって  夏休み…
Dialogue: 9,0:15:40.92,0:15:42.34,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,已經結束了…
Dialogue: 8,0:15:40.92,0:15:42.34,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,終わっちゃったんだ…
Dialogue: 9,0:15:52.62,0:15:55.23,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大谷同學  是這邊哦
Dialogue: 8,0:15:52.62,0:15:55.23,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,大谷さん　こっちですよ
Dialogue: 9,0:16:00.65,0:16:04.73,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大家  大家  都是異形
Dialogue: 8,0:16:00.65,0:16:04.73,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,みんな　みんな　エイリアン
Dialogue: 9,0:16:04.73,0:16:08.62,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大家  都會  變成異形
Dialogue: 8,0:16:04.73,0:16:08.62,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,みんな　なるんだ　エイリアン
Dialogue: 9,0:16:08.62,0:16:12.41,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,因為  大家  都會變的
Dialogue: 8,0:16:08.62,0:16:12.41,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,だって　みんな　なるんだもん
Dialogue: 9,0:16:12.41,0:16:16.16,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大家  都不  是小孩了
Dialogue: 8,0:16:12.41,0:16:16.16,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,もう子供は　卒業
Dialogue: 9,0:16:16.16,0:16:19.87,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,身體  會變  變成大人
Dialogue: 8,0:16:16.16,0:16:19.87,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,体がかわる　大人にかわる
Dialogue: 9,0:16:19.87,0:16:24.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大家  大家  都是異形
Dialogue: 8,0:16:19.87,0:16:24.00,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,みんな　みんな　エイリアン
Dialogue: 9,0:16:44.32,0:16:46.23,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦  怎麼辦
Dialogue: 8,0:16:44.32,0:16:46.23,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,どうしよう　どうしよう
Dialogue: 9,0:16:46.23,0:16:48.99,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大家都變成異形了
Dialogue: 8,0:16:46.23,0:16:48.99,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,みんな　エイリアンになっちゃったんだ
Dialogue: 9,0:16:48.99,0:16:50.21,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 8,0:16:48.99,0:16:50.21,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,大丈夫だよ
Dialogue: 9,0:16:52.03,0:16:56.45,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,因為  大家  都會變的
Dialogue: 8,0:16:52.03,0:16:56.45,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,だって　みんな　なるんだもん
Dialogue: 9,0:16:56.45,0:17:00.87,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大家  都不  是小孩了
Dialogue: 8,0:16:56.45,0:17:00.87,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,もう子供は　卒業
Dialogue: 9,0:17:00.87,0:17:05.55,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,身體  會變  變成大人
Dialogue: 8,0:17:00.87,0:17:05.55,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,体がかわる　大人にかわる
Dialogue: 9,0:17:05.55,0:17:09.88,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大家  大家  都是異形
Dialogue: 8,0:17:05.55,0:17:09.88,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,みんな　みんな　エイリアン
Dialogue: 9,0:17:12.22,0:17:15.26,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,大谷同學  比賽馬上就要開始了
Dialogue: 8,0:17:12.22,0:17:15.26,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,大谷さん　もうすぐ　レースが始まりますよ
Dialogue: 9,0:17:15.26,0:17:16.43,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,快點！
Dialogue: 8,0:17:15.26,0:17:16.43,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,急ぎなさい！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:15.32,0:18:15.97,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,由莉！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:15.32,0:18:15.97,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ゆり！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:23.04,0:18:24.79,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,快點  由莉！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:23.04,0:18:24.79,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,早く　ゆり！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:45.35,0:18:46.90,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,快點  快點！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:45.35,0:18:46.90,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,早く　早く！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:52.65,0:18:53.65,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,淋濕了嗎？
Dialogue: 8,0:18:52.65,0:18:53.65,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,濡れちゃった？
Dialogue: 9,0:18:57.07,0:18:59.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好像沒事
Dialogue: 8,0:18:57.07,0:18:59.08,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,大丈夫みたい
Dialogue: 9,0:19:07.25,0:19:08.59,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,很快就停了
Dialogue: 8,0:19:07.25,0:19:08.59,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,すぐ止めよ
Dialogue: 9,0:19:09.71,0:19:10.50,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 8,0:19:09.71,0:19:10.50,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 9,0:19:19.05,0:19:20.68,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,就要結束了呢
Dialogue: 8,0:19:19.05,0:19:20.68,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,終わっちゃうね
Dialogue: 9,0:19:23.39,0:19:24.43,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,暑假
Dialogue: 8,0:19:23.39,0:19:24.43,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,夏休み
Dialogue: 9,0:19:31.23,0:19:31.86,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 8,0:19:31.23,0:19:31.86,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん…
Dialogue: 9,0:19:40.28,0:19:41.66,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,久美…
Dialogue: 8,0:19:40.28,0:19:41.66,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,くみ… ちゃん…
Dialogue: 9,0:19:45.04,0:19:46.71,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我是在擔心你呢
Dialogue: 8,0:19:45.04,0:19:46.71,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,心配してるんだよ
Dialogue: 9,0:19:47.62,0:19:51.67,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,霞也好  美佑也好  大家都一樣
Dialogue: 8,0:19:47.62,0:19:51.67,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,かすみも　美佑ちゃんも　みんな
Dialogue: 9,0:19:55.05,0:19:57.26,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我們會一直在一起的
Dialogue: 8,0:19:55.05,0:19:57.26,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,私たち　いつも一緒だよ
Dialogue: 9,0:19:58.05,0:19:59.51,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,因為我們是朋友
Dialogue: 8,0:19:58.05,0:19:59.51,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,友だちだから
Dialogue: 9,0:20:00.89,0:20:01.76,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 8,0:20:00.89,0:20:01.76,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,うん…
Dialogue: 9,0:21:18.59,0:21:19.88,Text - CN,flashback,0,0,0,/,你要睡到什麼時候
Dialogue: 8,0:21:18.59,0:21:19.88,Text - JP,flashback,0,0,0,/,いつまで寝てるの
Dialogue: 9,0:21:20.47,0:21:22.18,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,暑假都過完了
Dialogue: 8,0:21:20.47,0:21:22.18,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,夏休みは終わってるのよ
Dialogue: 9,0:21:22.18,0:21:23.51,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,快起來
Dialogue: 8,0:21:22.18,0:21:23.51,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,早く起きなさい
Dialogue: 9,0:21:42.91,0:21:43.91,Text - CN,fade,0,0,0,/,{\t(830,0,1,\c&HE8E8E8&\3c&HFFFFFF&)}會一直在一起的
Dialogue: 8,0:21:42.91,0:21:43.91,Text - JP,fade,0,0,0,/,{\t(830,0,1,\c&HE8E8E8&\3c&HFFFFFF&)}いつも一緒だよ
Dialogue: 9,0:21:47.24,0:21:47.95,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,我努力
Dialogue: 8,0:21:47.24,0:21:47.95,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,頑張る
Dialogue: 9,0:21:54.75,0:21:57.30,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,這次一定不能再失敗了
Dialogue: 8,0:21:54.75,0:21:57.30,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,今度は失敗しないようにしなきゃ
Dialogue: 9,0:22:01.01,0:22:01.47,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,美佑
Dialogue: 8,0:22:01.01,0:22:01.47,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,美佑
Dialogue: 9,0:22:03.55,0:22:04.55,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,早啊
Dialogue: 8,0:22:03.55,0:22:04.55,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,おはよう
Dialogue: 9,0:22:04.55,0:22:05.85,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,早…  早啊
Dialogue: 8,0:22:04.55,0:22:05.85,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,お… はよう
Dialogue: 9,0:22:05.85,0:22:07.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,由莉  早啊
Dialogue: 8,0:22:05.85,0:22:07.31,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,ゆり　おはよう
Dialogue: 9,0:22:07.31,0:22:08.39,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,早…  早啊
Dialogue: 8,0:22:07.31,0:22:08.39,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,おっ… おはよう
Dialogue: 9,0:22:20.03,0:22:21.90,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,早安！
Dialogue: 8,0:22:20.03,0:22:21.90,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,おはようございます！
Dialogue: 9,0:22:22.36,0:22:23.99,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,早安！
Dialogue: 8,0:22:22.36,0:22:23.99,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,おはようございます！
Dialogue: 9,0:22:23.99,0:22:24.57,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,…好
Dialogue: 8,0:22:23.99,0:22:24.57,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,…ます
Dialogue: 9,0:22:25.03,0:22:26.78,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,今天第二學期就開始了
Dialogue: 8,0:22:25.03,0:22:26.78,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,今日から 2 学期です
Dialogue: 9,0:22:26.78,0:22:29.04,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,會比上學期更忙
Dialogue: 8,0:22:26.78,0:22:29.04,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,1 学期よりも忙しくなります
Dialogue: 9,0:22:29.04,0:22:30.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,大家一起加油吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:22:29.04,0:22:30.54,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,皆さん　頑張りましょう！
Dialogue: 9,0:22:31.04,0:22:32.25,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,遠峰同學！
Dialogue: 8,0:22:31.04,0:22:32.25,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,遠峰さん！
Dialogue: 9,0:22:32.25,0:22:33.08,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,到！
Dialogue: 8,0:22:32.25,0:22:33.08,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,はい！
Dialogue: 9,0:22:33.08,0:22:35.12,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,繼續優雅地使用它吧
Dialogue: 8,0:22:33.08,0:22:35.12,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,これまで通り優雅に使ってね
Dialogue: 9,0:22:35.88,0:22:36.79,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,川村同學！
Dialogue: 8,0:22:35.88,0:22:36.79,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,川村さん！
Dialogue: 9,0:22:37.29,0:22:37.88,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,到
Dialogue: 8,0:22:37.29,0:22:37.88,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,はい
Dialogue: 9,0:22:37.88,0:22:39.80,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,繼續聰明地使用它吧
Dialogue: 8,0:22:37.88,0:22:39.80,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,これまで通り賢く使ってね
Dialogue: 9,0:22:44.05,0:22:47.18,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,這次可別再殺掉它了哦  大谷同學
Dialogue: 8,0:22:44.05,0:22:47.18,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,今度は殺さないでね　大谷さん
Dialogue: 9,0:22:49.47,0:22:50.77,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,那麼  大家
Dialogue: 8,0:22:49.47,0:22:50.77,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,さあ　皆さん
Dialogue: 9,0:22:50.77,0:22:52.89,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,第二學期也一起加油吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:22:50.77,0:22:52.89,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,2 学期も頑張っていきましょう！
Dialogue: 9,0:24:25.78,0:24:26.19,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,什麼?!
Dialogue: 8,0:24:25.78,0:24:26.19,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,なに!?
Dialogue: 9,0:24:39.71,0:24:40.95,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,大家冷靜
Dialogue: 8,0:24:39.71,0:24:40.95,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,皆さん落ち着いて
Dialogue: 9,0:24:40.95,0:24:42.75,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,不要慌張  有序行動
Dialogue: 8,0:24:40.95,0:24:42.75,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,慌てずに行動してください
Dialogue: 9,0:24:55.72,0:24:59.44,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,結果這隻異形  什麼都沒做呢
Dialogue: 8,0:24:55.72,0:24:59.44,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,結局　このエイリアン　何もしなかったね
Dialogue: 9,0:25:00.14,0:25:02.31,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,只是又大又礙事而已嗎
Dialogue: 8,0:25:00.14,0:25:02.31,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,でかくて　邪魔なだけか
Dialogue: 9,0:25:22.79,0:25:25.88,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,Yellow  Knife  植物型異形
Dialogue: 8,0:25:22.79,0:25:25.88,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,イエローナイフ　植物型エイリアン
Dialogue: 9,0:25:26.25,0:25:29.42,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,會把靠近的生物當作樣本吸收
Dialogue: 8,0:25:26.25,0:25:29.42,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,近づいた生物をサンプルとして取り込み
Dialogue: 9,0:25:29.42,0:25:32.80,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,分析對方的弱點  為了保護自己
Dialogue: 8,0:25:29.42,0:25:32.80,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,弱点を解析　自己を守るために
Dialogue: 9,0:25:32.80,0:25:37.85,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,會發動精神攻擊  括號  食用  括號完
Dialogue: 8,0:25:32.80,0:25:37.85,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,精神攻撃を行う　括弧食用括弧閉じる
Dialogue: 9,0:25:40.89,0:25:42.56,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真是怪了
Dialogue: 8,0:25:40.89,0:25:42.56,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,おかしいなあ
Dialogue: 9,0:25:42.56,0:25:44.86,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我明明沒叫這種東西來啊
Dialogue: 8,0:25:42.56,0:25:44.86,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,こんなの頼んでないのに
Dialogue: 9,0:25:45.73,0:25:48.28,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,難道是黏在宇宙飛船上過來的？
Dialogue: 8,0:25:45.73,0:25:48.28,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,宇宙船にくっついてきたのかなあ
Dialogue: 9,0:25:49.19,0:25:52.57,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,明明暑假作業都還沒弄完呢
Dialogue: 8,0:25:49.19,0:25:52.57,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,夏休みの宿題も済んでないってのに
Dialogue: 9,0:25:52.57,0:25:55.03,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,真是饒了我叭
Dialogue: 8,0:25:52.57,0:25:55.03,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,勘弁しちくりよ　ホント
Dialogue: 9,0:28:41.74,0:28:44.03,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我喜歡爸爸
Dialogue: 8,0:28:41.74,0:28:44.03,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,お父さん　好き
Dialogue: 9,0:28:44.70,0:28:46.91,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我喜歡媽媽
Dialogue: 8,0:28:44.70,0:28:46.91,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,お母さん　好き
Dialogue: 9,0:28:46.91,0:28:49.83,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我喜歡哥哥
Dialogue: 8,0:28:46.91,0:28:49.83,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,お兄ちゃん　好き
Dialogue: 9,0:28:50.33,0:28:51.71,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我喜歡由莉
Dialogue: 8,0:28:50.33,0:28:51.71,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ゆりちゃん　好き
Dialogue: 9,0:28:52.29,0:28:54.00,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我喜歡久美
Dialogue: 8,0:28:52.29,0:28:54.00,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,くみちゃん　好き
Dialogue: 9,0:28:55.30,0:28:57.09,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我喜歡 Borg
Dialogue: 8,0:28:55.30,0:28:57.09,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,ボウグ　好き
Dialogue: 9,0:28:58.22,0:29:00.30,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我喜歡久川老師
Dialogue: 8,0:28:58.22,0:29:00.30,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,久川先生　好き
Dialogue: 9,0:29:01.72,0:29:03.68,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我喜歡美佑
Dialogue: 8,0:29:01.72,0:29:03.68,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,美佑ちゃん　好き
Dialogue: 9,0:29:04.56,0:29:07.48,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,我喜歡異形
Dialogue: 8,0:29:04.56,0:29:07.48,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,エイリアン　好き
Dialogue: 9,0:29:08.02,0:29:09.64,Text - CN,,0,0,0,ep4,因為我喜歡啊
Dialogue: 8,0:29:08.02,0:29:09.64,Text - JP,,0,0,0,ep4,好きだからだよ
